e\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_WYR_PaintingPuzzle_SolutionPainting3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_WYR_PaintingPuzzle_SolutionPainting3\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">9e6fbe35-e0fd-4b3a-be5b-b75935e17fc0</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:9e6fbe35-e0fd-4b3a-be5b-b75935e17fc0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:9e6fbe35-e0fd-4b3a-be5b-b75935e17fc0\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the Chamber of Justice in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Wyrmway\" title=\"The Wyrmway\">The Wyrmway</a> as part of a puzzle to solve <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrmway#Passing_the_Trials\" title=\"Wyrmway\">the trial of justice</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Remove_Curse\" title=\"Remove Curse\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/25px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/38px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/50px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Remove Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/25px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Remove_Curse\" title=\"Remove Curse\">Remove Curse</a> must be cast on either the judge or the painting itself before it is possible to pick it up.</li>\n<li>This item is the correct solution to the puzzle.</li>\n<li>This item dissapears after completing the puzzle, and is replaced by a new item called <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cell\" title=\"Cell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/%27The_Cell%27_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-%27The_Cell%27_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/%27The_Cell%27_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-%27The_Cell%27_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/%27The_Cell%27_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-%27The_Cell%27_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/%27The_Cell%27_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-%27The_Cell%27_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/%27The_Cell%27_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cell\" title=\"Cell\">Cell</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202941\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1872/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27167/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6452/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐exp